  "description": "Yong-Ho Kang, chairman of Choi Sung Group, wakes up in the body of the company’s newest recruit. Now that the seat of power is suddenly empty, his entire family starts scrambling for the position, and the group’s future looks far from secure. But Yong-Ho isn’t about to sit back just because he’s now at the bottom of the corporate food chain. This is his company, and he’s going to save it himself. On this corporate battlefield, a newbie with a chairman’s mind is about to call the shots.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
